    "legend_note": "Publishing, film, TV, radio, music; advertising, design and photography; arts, performance, museums and libraries — and also sport, recreation and gambling, which the census cannot separate from the arts. So ski resorts score high for their instructors and lift staff. Nationally 3.9%. The popup gives the self-employed share: the freelance creative scene. Blank where fewer than 60 residents are in work: below that the sample behind the share is a handful of people."
